  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "主路径",
      "items": [
        "CLI 创建 FilteringService，再把 capture 配置和 add_packet 回调交给 capture 适配层。",
        "Scapy 每收到一个包就回调 service.add_packet，再转给 PacketGrouper。",
        "只有通过 is_valid_dns_packet 的包才进入缓冲区。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "批量与过滤",
      "items": [
        "缓冲区达到 group_size 或超时后，grouper 调用 extract_dns_info 生成不可变 DnsInfo 列表。",
        "BurstFilterEngine 按 registered_domain 分组，用 xxhash32 取模定位桶。",
        "同域追加；哈希冲突时按旧策略把一侧移到 ColdFilter。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "检测与收尾",
      "items": [
        "PeriodicDetector 取 burst_infos() 快照，检测规则不持有过滤器锁。",
        "PayloadSizeDetector 找到 payload_size > 100 的记录并交给 DetectionSink。",
        "service.close() 先 flush 尾批，再停止检测线程；冷检测默认不启动。"
      ]
    }
  ]
